{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "label": "ADR-0007: Gradebook is the only grade store", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_single_store", "label": "Decision: the gradebook is the single grade store (no plugin-side grade column)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two stores can disagree: a Grader-report edit overrides the grade so later raw-grade writes no longer change the final grade; a grade on the entry row cannot hold a learner with no entry; a plugin-owned copy needs its own backup/restore/reset code. reflectjournal_update_grades() looks empty on purpose, with a docblock linking here so nobody fixes it into a second writer."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_return_codes", "label": "grade_update() return codes: OK / ITEM_LOCKED / FAILED / MULTIPLE", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Return codes are checked on every write; MULTIPLE means a bug and raises a coding exception; ITEM_LOCKED tells the teacher to unlock in the gradebook and nothing is retried."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_module_callbacks", "label": "Module grade callbacks: reflectjournal_grade_item_update / reflectjournal_update_grades pair", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core calls them together, in that order, from grade_update_mod_grades() and reports a developer warning if only one exists; update_grades only ensures the grade item exists and pushes nothing because the plugin holds no grades."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_feedback_not_mirrored", "label": "Feedback is not mirrored into the gradebook", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feedback is visible the moment it is saved (PRD L3) while grades follow the gradebook hidden setting; one store cannot serve both rules and two copies would drift, so the gradebook Feedback column stays empty for this activity."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_mod_assign_sync_pattern", "label": "Rejected alternative: mod_assign-style plugin-owned grade table re-pushed on rescale", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-24", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "assign_rescale_activity_grades() rescales its own table and pushes again; rejected here because two stores can disagree and a grade on the entry row cannot grade an entryless learner."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "target": "docs_architecture", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "target": "docs_prd", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "target": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_single_store", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_single_store", "target": "docs_architecture_grade_update", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_return_codes", "target": "docs_architecture_grade_update", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_module_callbacks", "target": "docs_architecture_grade_update", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_feedback_not_mirrored", "target": "docs_prd_l3_immediate_feedback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_mod_assign_sync_pattern", "target": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store_single_store", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0007-gradebook-is-the-only-grade-store.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0007_gradebook_is_the_only_grade_store", "target"